Subject: [PATCH 034/118] go.mod: take sing-vmess from the podkop-engine fork
 (v0.2.8-pdk13.1)

github.com/FiyeroT/sing-vmess v0.2.8-pdk13.1 is the sing-vmess of this line plus one
change: under Vision in direct mode the connection reports the read side
replaceable, so the copy loop reads the raw TCP connection (splice, no
buffer held while idle) once the buffered remainder is out.
---
 go.mod | 2 ++
 go.sum | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

